exports[`the app head and llms.txt (#701, #702) > keeps llms.txt 1`] = `
"# Libell

> A free app that shows which wheels of your motorhome or caravan to raise, and onto which ramp step. Uses your phone or a sensor box, and works offline.

Libell helps you level your motorhome or caravan with the phone you already have, without guessing.

- Works fully offline — the network is only used to fetch updates of the app itself.
- Your settings stay on your phone — no account and no tracking. The only thing Libell sends is anonymous counts of how the app is used, which you can turn off.
- Libell is free and open source (MIT license).
- Languages, each with a page about Libell: [Català](https://libell.app/ca/), [Čeština](https://libell.app/cs/), [Dansk](https://libell.app/da/), [Deutsch](https://libell.app/de/), [Eesti](https://libell.app/et/), [English](https://libell.app/en/), [Español](https://libell.app/es/), [Français](https://libell.app/fr/), [Hrvatski](https://libell.app/hr/), [Íslenska](https://libell.app/is/), [Italiano](https://libell.app/it/), [Latviešu](https://libell.app/lv/), [Lietuvių](https://libell.app/lt/), [Magyar](https://libell.app/hu/), [Nederlands](https://libell.app/nl/), [Norsk bokmål](https://libell.app/nb/), [Polski](https://libell.app/pl/), [Português](https://libell.app/pt/), [Română](https://libell.app/ro/), [Slovenčina](https://libell.app/sk/), [Slovenščina](https://libell.app/sl/), [Suomi](https://libell.app/fi/), [Svenska](https://libell.app/sv/), [Türkçe](https://libell.app/tr/).

## Links

- [Open Libell](https://libell.app/): the app itself, in the browser or installed on the home screen
- [Source code and README](https://github.com/moggleif/libell): how it works, the Sensorbox models it supports, and how to report a problem
- [Privacy policy](https://libell.app/privacy/): what Libell stores on the phone and the one thing it sends
"
`;

